<title>SWITZERLAND: CS Elektrowatt profit offsets charges.</title>
<headline>CS Elektrowatt profit offsets charges.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS Holding said a book profit of around one billion Swiss francs from the sale of most of its 44.9 percent stake in Elektrowatt AG would offset restructuring charges of around billion francs announced in July.</p>
<p>The sale of Elektrowatt would therefore not have any effect on CS Holding's expected net loss of 2.1 billion francs in 1996, a CS Holding spokesman said.</p>
</text>
